<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd 10-year JGB yield falls to record low.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd 10-year JGB yield falls to record low.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The yield of the key 182nd 10-year cash Japanese government bond (JGB) fell to 2.480 percent in early afternoon Tokyo trade on Tuesday, the lowest yield for any benchmark JGB.</p>
<p>The previous record low was 2.485 percent set on July 7, 1995. -- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8676</p>
</text>
